@using Microsoft.AspNetCore.Html
@using URegister.Core.Contracts
@using URegister.Infrastructure.Constants
@using URegister.Infrastructure.Model.Report
@model StatisticalReportViewModel
@functions {
    public IHtmlContent card(string color, string icon, string label, object value)
    {
        return new HtmlString($@"
            <div class='ui fluid center aligned card {color}'>
                <div class='content'>
                    <div class='header'><i class='{icon} icon'></i> {label}</div>
                    <div class='description'>
                        <h2 class='ui header'>{value}</h2>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>");
    }
}
@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Статистическа справка";
}

<div id="page-loader" class="ui page dimmer">
    <div class="ui big text loader">Зареждане...</div>
</div>

<div id="statisticsContainer" class="container">
    <div class="ui fluid container basic clearing">
        <div class="ui accordion">
            <div class="title">
                <i class="dropdown icon"></i>
                Филтър
            </div>
            <div class="content">
                <div class="column ui segment green">
                    <form asp-action="GenerateStatistics" method="post" class="ui form">
                        <div class="fields">
                            <div class="two wide field">
                                @Html.EditorFor(model => model.DateFrom, "DateTime")
                            </div>
                            <div class="two wide field">
                                @Html.EditorFor(model => model.DateTo, "DateTime")
                            </div>                          
                            <div class="ui two wide right aligned field custom buttons">
                                <div class="ui fluid container basic clearing">
                                    <button type="submit" class="ui primary button" style="margin-top:1.5rem">
                                        <i class="icon search"></i>
                                        Търси
                                    </button>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </form>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
    
    @if (Model != null)
    {
        <div class="ui raised segment">
            @* <h2 class="ui teal header"><i class="filter icon"></i> Резултати от статистиката</h2> *@

            @if (Model.RegisterTypeEntry == RegisterTypeEntry.Applicant)
            {
                <div class="ui stackable doubling center aligned three column relaxed grid equal height">
                    <div class="sixteen wide column">
                        <h3 class="ui centered header"><i class="layer group icon"></i> Подадени заявления</h3>
                    </div>

                    <div class="column">
                        @card("blue", "list alternate outline", "Общо", Model.TotalSentProcesses)
                    </div>
                 
                    <div class="column">
                        @card("green", "building", "На гише", Model.SentCounterProcesses)
                    </div>
                 
                    <div class="column">
                        @card("teal", "wifi", "По интернет", Model.SentOnlineProcesses)
                    </div>                 
                </div>
            }

            <div class="ui hidden divider"></div>

            <div class="ui stackable doubling center aligned four column relaxed grid equal height">
                <div class="sixteen wide column">
                    <h3 class="ui centered header"><i class="th list icon"></i> Вписани услуги в регистъра</h3>
                </div>

                @* Row 1 *@
                <div class="column">
                    @card("blue", "list alternate outline", "Общо", Model.TotalRegisteredProcesses)
                </div>
                <div class="column">
                    @card("green", "file alternate outline", "За първоначално вписване", Model.RegisteredProcessesInitialRegistrations)
                </div>
                <div class="column">
                    @card("yellow", "exchange", "За промяна на обстоятелствата", Model.RegisteredProcessesCircumstanceChanges)
                </div>
                <div class="column">
                    @card("red", "trash", "За заличаване", Model.RegisteredProcessesDeletions)
                </div>

                @* Row 2 *@
                <div class="column">
                    @card("orange", "wrench", "Изправени технически грешки", Model.TechnicalErrorsFixed)
                </div>
                <div class="column">
                    @card("red", "ban", "Постановени откази", Model.Rejections)
                </div>
                <div class="column">
                    @card("blue", "info circle", "Дадени указания", Model.Instructions)
                </div>
                <div class="column">
                    @card("blue", "certificate", "Издадени удостоверения", Model.IssuedCertificates)
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="ui hidden divider"></div>

            <div class="ui stackable doubling center aligned three column relaxed grid equal height">
                <div class="sixteen wide column">
                    <h3 class="ui centered header"><i class="users icon"></i> Потребители в регистъра</h3>
                </div>
                <div class="column">
                    @card("blue", "user plus", "Създадени", Model.CreatedUsers)
                </div>
                <div class="column">
                    @card("green", "check circle", "Активни", Model.ActiveUsers)
                </div>
                <div class="column">
                    @card("red", "times circle", "Неактивни", Model.InactiveUsers)
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    }
</div>

@section Scripts
{
    <script src="~/js/admin/report/report.js" asp-append-version="true"></script>
}